  "instruction": "Use the Harvard Shuttle printable schedule open in Microsoft Edge. On a weekday evening, you are at Mather House at 9:15 pm and want the first shuttle to Lamont Library. Create a Sticky Note with four ordered checkpoints: the Mather House departure time, the Quad time, the Law School time, and the Lamont Library arrival time.",
  "source": "https://prod-transportation.drupalsites.harvard.edu/sites/g/files/omnuum12016/files/2025-08/All%20Shuttle%20Routes.pdf",
  "gt_steps": [
    "Find the evening Mather–Crimson–Overnight timetable in the Harvard Shuttle PDF.",
    "Find the first Mather House departure after 9:15 pm: 9:20 pm.",
    "Follow the same row to the Quad at 9:40 pm, the Law School at 9:45 pm, and Lamont Library at 9:53 pm.",
    "Create a Sticky Note containing the four checkpoints in order."
  ],
